<para>Uses <computeroutput>cudaFree</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>hipFree</computeroutput> when unified memory is hardware-backed, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_unified_memory_allocator_1af618c466d7b4fa30416347723c39210e" kindref="member">free()</ref></computeroutput> on the CPU fallback path.</para>
